{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24599","headline":"梦上山 · 白居易","name":"梦上山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜梦上嵩山，独携藜杖出。\n千岩与万壑，游览皆周毕。\n梦中足不病，健似少年日。\n既悟神返初，依然旧形质。\n始知形神内，形病神无疾。\n形神两是幻，梦寐俱非实。\n昼行虽蹇涩，夜步颇安逸。\n昼夜既平分，其间何得失。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24599.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24599","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}